        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Combat and Challenges:</strong> Battle menacing enemies, overcome dangerous obstacles, and escape deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.poster.avif?t=1764338052\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.webm?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.mp4?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate Puzzles:</strong> Tackle challenging puzzles that test your assassination skills and strategic thinking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secretive Environments</strong>: Explore environments filled with secret passageways and off-limit areas, adding depth and intrigue to your missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Tools:</strong> Utilize various tools, including distractions, disguises, hiding spots, traps, portals, and rifles to outsmart your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Types:</strong> Confront enemy types with unique and deadly behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.poster.avif?t=1764338052\" width=624 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.webm?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.mp4?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and Customization:</strong> Collect relics and unlock new outfits for Uhilant, adding a layer of personalization to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visuals and Soundtrack:</strong> Experience beautifully crafted scale model-style visuals and a relaxing, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Approaches:</strong> Complete each level in various ways—choose to be silent and stealthy or forceful and aggressive. Aim to collect the elusive backpack or finish within a specific number of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Levels:</strong> Enjoy 55 levels that experiment with the game’s mechanics in numerous ways, challenging you to understand and manipulate the rules to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.poster.avif?t=1764338052\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.webm?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.mp4?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Story:</strong> Discover the story of the Uhilant character through the items he carries, adding narrative depth to your journey.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Combat and Challenges:</strong> Battle menacing enemies, overcome dangerous obstacles, and escape deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.poster.avif?t=1764338052\" width=624 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.webm?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/f0296f27163b542a338247ebf44d3e3f.mp4?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate Puzzles:</strong> Tackle challenging puzzles that test your assassination skills and strategic thinking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secretive Environments</strong>: Explore environments filled with secret passageways and off-limit areas, adding depth and intrigue to your missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Tools:</strong> Utilize various tools, including distractions, disguises, hiding spots, traps, portals, and rifles to outsmart your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Types:</strong> Confront enemy types with unique and deadly behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.poster.avif?t=1764338052\" width=624 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.webm?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/1a5e06d523ba809b72fdb91223f0106d.mp4?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and Customization:</strong> Collect relics and unlock new outfits for Uhilant, adding a layer of personalization to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visuals and Soundtrack:</strong> Experience beautifully crafted scale model-style visuals and a relaxing, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Approaches:</strong> Complete each level in various ways—choose to be silent and stealthy or forceful and aggressive. Aim to collect the elusive backpack or finish within a specific number of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Levels:</strong> Enjoy 55 levels that experiment with the game’s mechanics in numerous ways, challenging you to understand and manipulate the rules to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.poster.avif?t=1764338052\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.webm?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121850/extras/b14dbd4b4c7b720a96bfd78249b0eb25.mp4?t=1764338052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Story:</strong> Discover the story of the Uhilant character through the items he carries, adding narrative depth to your journey.</p>",
        "short_description": "Cozy, turn-based puzzle game set in a dystopian land overshadowed by a long war. You've made the bold choice to survive instead of becoming cannon fodder. Now You are - &quot;The Uhilant&quot;, war dodger. Immerse yourself in this charming adventure, where every move brings you closer to freedom",
